From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:55:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1180/3799] soh: rename func_809CC648 -> EnBubble_CheckAcHit

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: consumes an AC hit: a hit on the outer sphere only bounces the bubble away from the attacker, while any other hit arms the pop delay and returns true.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bubble/z_en_bubble.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bubble/z_en_bubble.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bubble/z_en_bubble.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bubble/z_en_bubble.c
index d7fc07af0..114cb050a 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bubble/z_en_bubble.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bubble/z_en_bubble.c
@@ -287,7 +287,8 @@ void EnBubble_Fly(EnBubble* this, PlayState* play) {
     Math_ApproachF(&this->velocityFromBump.z, 0.0f, 0.3f, 0.1f);
 }
 
-u32 func_809CC648(EnBubble* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_809CC648: consumes an AC hit: a hit on the outer sphere only bounces the bubble away from the attacker, while any other hit arms the pop delay and returns true.
+u32 EnBubble_CheckAcHit(EnBubble* this) {
     if (((this->colliderSphere.base.acFlags & AC_HIT) != 0) == false) {
         return false;
     }
@@ -314,7 +315,7 @@ u32 EnBubble_DetectPop(EnBubble* this, PlayState* play) {
         this->unk_208 = 8;
         return true;
     }
-    return func_809CC648(this);
+    return EnBubble_CheckAcHit(this);  // was func_809CC648 [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
 void func_809CC774(EnBubble* this) {
